+      1. Add or confirm REQ-* and SCENARIO-* anchors for V575 terminal replay, nested methodology binding, method-source locking, same-roadmap gates, protected historical artifacts, and atomic output. Write focused tests first.
+      2. Use scripts/summarize_artifact.py and raw field replay. Preserve each upstream honest_verdict, verdict_class, gate_check_summary, readiness score, adversarial disposition, and hash. Never infer GREEN from Exp6589.
