+      4. Lock arXiv:2608.23526, arXiv:2608.23551, and arXiv:2608.21466 source IDs, retrieved titles, method boundaries, controls, metrics, and non-claims. No source result counts as Carnot evidence.
+      5. Resolve content-derived cache identities for unsloth/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-GGUF and unsloth/gemma-4-31B-it-GGUF without loading or downloading a model. Record whether two idle, runtime-owned RTX 3090 devices are available.
