+      7. Attack invented CFR benefit, Exp6589 block erasure, principle-wrapper misread, missing row hashes, methodology invention, paper-result transfer, legacy-model substitution, unowned GPU eviction, gate-field drift, and historical artifact mutation.
+      8. Set v575_cfr_reducer_ready_score=1.0 only when both CFR row streams replay completely. Set v575_dual_gpu_canary_ready_score=1.0 only when both mandated caches resolve and two idle owned GPUs are visible. A zero dual-GPU score must not block the scientific phases.
